module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.identity_absent_graph_traversal

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data identity_absent_graph_traversal: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "identity_absent_graph_traversal" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "identity-absent graph traversal (a walk over a graph the COMPILER built re-enters shared nodes because it cannot carry a `visited` or memo key — the nodes have no identity the model is allowed to name — so the only two arms available locally are to PAY the re-entry, or to key on a substitute the substrate forbids. ",

    "THE TRAP IS THAT THE ARMS DIFFER IN KIND AND THE CHEAP-LOOKING ONE IS THE UNSAFE ONE: paying is a cost, visible and bounded; keying on a substitute silently skips a DISTINCT node believed already visited, drops whatever that node contributed, and reports nothing. ",

    "THE MECHANISM, structural and checkable by reading rather than by measurement: `v1.compiler.infer_emit_info` `collect_type_node_import_surface_names` recurses on BOTH `children` AND the `inferred` resolved node, so a shared type DAG is traversed as a tree and a node reachable by k paths is walked k times. ",

    "The key does not exist. ",

    "`std.occurrence_identity` `occurrence_identity_scope_law` names filename, SourceSpan, authored name, structural Node equality and content hash as FORBIDDEN identity inputs, and `NodeOccurrenceIdentity` `OccurrenceSynthetic` — which is what the compiler mints for a node no author wrote — carries no id at all, so every synthesised node compares equal to every other and a visited set built on it would skip the wrong one. ",

    "The remaining candidate is host allocation identity, which exists only in the realization and not in the model. ",

    "RUNG: OUTSIDE THE LADDER, and the earlier revision of this row said `mitigatable`, which was inflation of exactly the kind section 4b(1) names. ",

    "The invalid state is writable, nothing refuses it, and its failure is a silent skip — section 4b puts silent wrongness outside the ladder rather than low on it. ",

    "What that revision offered as the mitigation was that no author has yet needed such a traversal and that review might catch one; neither is containment by a total operation, a typed outcome, a bound, a rollback or an isolation, and no discriminating RED exists on any acceptance path, so no rung above the floor is claimable by executed evidence. ",

    "ONE PARTIAL CONTAINMENT IS REAL AND DOES NOT LIFT THE CLASS: at the measured seam a dropped name reaches an emitted Rust crate, where rustc refuses it as E0422/E0425/E0433 far from the cause, and the regen byte-identity gate would show the drift. ",

    "That is a property of THAT seam's consumer being a compiled artifact, not of the class — a traversal whose consumer is a verdict rather than a compilation has no such backstop — and section 4b sets a class's rung at the MINIMUM across its in-scope paths. ",

    "CEILING: structural impossibility, and per section 4b(3) the trigger names the CAPABILITY rather than an artifact — an identity for synthesised occurrences, sufficient for a `visited` set over inferred type nodes to be authorable in `.dag` at all. ",

    "Nothing less retires it: a faster traversal, a memo at one seam, or a counter measuring the amplification all leave the key absent and the unsafe arm equally reachable. ",

    "An intermediate rung is available and is NOT claimed here because nothing implements it: a typed refusal at the traversal seam would make the class mechanically preventable while leaving the invalid state writable. ",

    "THE ESCAPES THAT LOOK AVAILABLE AND ARE NOT, listed because this class is mostly discovered by trying them, and each was closed by EXECUTION rather than by argument — deleting the producer, replacing it with the cheaper sub-producers beside it, reading `TypeSummary.field_import_surface_names` instead (which is CIRCULAR, being produced BY this walk in `build_field_type_map`, and answers a different relation), and hoisting the work earlier (there is nothing to hoist: each item belongs to one module and each module is emitted once). ",

    "Two further hypotheses about the COST were falsified the same way and are worth not repeating: the list-copy lowering, and the match-scrutinee deep clone. ",

    "The measured populations, the amplification, the per-escape figures and the two falsifications are recorded once, dated, with their method and their non-enrollment stated, in the plan document `emit-type-surface-traversal-cost`, which is bound to this traversal and its two consumers in `gunbc.doc_graph_roots` and retires when they move; they are deliberately not transcribed here, because a number copied into a roster row is the positional-citation failure one entry up wearing different clothes. ",

    "RECOGNITION RULE: when you reach for a visited or memo key over a graph the compiler built rather than the author wrote, enumerate the keys available to you; if every candidate is one the identity authority forbids, the deficit is upstream in the identity algebra and NEITHER local arm is a repair — the amplification is the symptom and the missing identity is the class.)",

    "NOT A MEMBER OF THE ABSENCE FAMILY DESPITE THE IDENTITY SPELLING, recorded here so a later consolidation does not take the word for the class. Every member of that family consumes an EMPTINESS AS AN AFFIRMATIVE VERDICT -- a zero, a default bucket, an unreported check, an unenrolled witness. Here the absence is a SUBSTRATE CAPABILITY, no verdict is produced at all, and the harm is a forced choice between two arms of different kinds. The family axis and the full membership are carried in [[absent_reads_identically_to_never_looked]]. ",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
